        { "tipe": "paragraph", "text": "(i) + (iii): $5x + 5y = 15 \\Rightarrow x + y = 3$ … (iv)" },
        { "tipe": "paragraph", "text": "(ii) + 2(i): $x - y + 2z + 4x + 6y - 2z = 7 + 8$" },
